ExLlamaV3
---------

Crucible's EXL3 format specification and its CPU reference checks use ExLlamaV3 as a format
reference. The verified upstream source is commit
d3739fd393337b1ff4d6c2a342b12f0c87a9592f of https://github.com/turboderp-org/exllamav3.

